# Secrets. Nothing here ever enters the repository.
# Wildcards cover both casings, since gitignore is case-sensitive on Linux and
# CI even though Windows is not. The convention is appsettings.Secrets.json.
*.Secrets.json
*.secrets.json
!*.Secrets.example.json
.env
.env.*

# .NET
bin/
obj/
# tools/probe/probe-output/ is deliberately tracked and must stay outside bin/.
# The transcripts are the evidence behind the phase P findings, and while they
# were excluded here nothing recorded in PROGRESS.md was checkable without the
# build machine [H.1].
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Rider / VS Code
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent tooling. Local session state, not repository content.
.claude/

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
